ovider should be integrated as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"text":" implementation inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"text":" so as to provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"text":" implementation to use.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It implements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ListItemComponentTokens"},{"text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"borders (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"), colors (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"), opacities (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and dimensions (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BlueCoatThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat/documentation/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","